<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian 42-day T-bill sold at average 11.6967 pct.</title>
<headline>Nigerian 42-day T-bill sold at average 11.6967 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nigeria's Central Bank said on Friday it sold 3,075 million naira worth of treasury bills carrying a weighted average rate of 11.6967 percent.</p>
<p>Bids totalled 3,075 miliion naira and the true yield will be 11.8592 percent.</p>
<p>Last week's sales were 3,150 million naira worth of 42-day treasury bills at a weighted average rate of 11.7447 percent.</p>
